      },
      {
        "speaker": "B",
        "tts": "아빠, 그건 옛날이자나.",
        "en": "Daddy, that was the old days."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "A",
        "tts": "...맞는 말이네.",
        "en": "...that's fair."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "B",
        "tts": "그치? 그러니까 올려줘잉~",
        "en": "Wight? So waise it, pwease~",
        "emote": "shy"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "A",
        "tts": "대신 설거지 도와주기.",
        "en": "Only if you help with the dishes."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "B",
        "tts": "...아빠 그냥 오백원 줘.",
        "en": "...Daddy, just give me 500.",
        "emote": "pout"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "A",
        "tts": "야! 방금 전엔 천원이라며!",
        "en": "Hey! You JUST said 1,000!",
        "emote": "laugh"
      }
    ],
    "hashtags": [
